<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">ICON: Indirect Prompt Injection Defense for Agents 
<br class="ltx_break">based on <span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">I</span>nference-Time <span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">C</span>orrecti<span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">on</span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Che Wang
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
